nnel, uses a dedicated Access application, operations group, and MFA rather than the DMCA Admin group.", "source_file": "deploy/monitoring/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "deploy_monitoring_readme_monitoring_delivery_validation", "label": "Monitoring Delivery Validation", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Production readiness requires version-matched configuration validation and a test alert proving both firing and resolved delivery; syntax-only success is insufficient.", "source_file": "deploy/monitoring/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "deploy_monitoring_readme_alert_noise_control", "label": "Low-Traffic Alert Noise Control", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Alerts combine a minimum sample count with a sustained-duration condition so a single request during low player activity does not create noise.", "source_file": "deploy/monitoring/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "deploy_monitoring_readme_supplemental_native_alerts", "label": "Supplemental Native Infrastructure Alerts", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "deploy/monitoring/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "deploy_monitoring_readme_private_metrics_ingress", "target": "deploy_monitoring_readme_private_monitoring_overlay", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "deploy/monitoring/README.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "deploy_monitoring_readme_private_monitoring_overlay", "target": "deploy_monitoring_readme_prometheus_capacity_observability", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": 